      <description><![CDATA[
        As a 170-member Indian contingent heads to Maduru Oya for Exercise Mitra Shakti 2026, New Delhi and Colombo are doubling down on regional interoperability and counter-terrorism readiness.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The 170-strong Indian contingent is spearheaded by a battalion of the Rajputana Rifles alongside Indian Air Force personnel.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The curriculum emphasizes tactical drills for semi-urban counter-terrorism, convoy protection, and UN-mandated peace operations.
